{"id":"a504f38ba12874d6","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence.md","title":"Henkin and Löb Frame Correspondence","display":"lem-henkin-frame-correspondence — Henkin and Löb Frame Correspondence","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence","aliases":["89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence"],"display":"lem-henkin-frame-correspondence — Henkin and Löb Frame Correspondence","depends_on":["[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-henkin-frame-correspondence — Henkin and Löb Frame Correspondence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ed2b55b4cca2b52\" href=\"?note=5ed2b55b4cca2b52\" title=\"89-df-henkin-modal-logic\">89-df-henkin-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为非空 Kripke 框架；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\models A\">\\(F\\models A\\)</span> 对所有赋值与全部世界量化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\)</span> 表示传递且逆良基。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}frame\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF\\models\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\\to\\Box p\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow F\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\to\\Box p\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}frame\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF\\models\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\\to\\Box p\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow F\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\to\\Box p\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 11 章，pp.150–151，Theorem 1（Lon Berk）；框架刻画见第 4 章 pp.74–77。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>Löb 公理蕴含 Henkin 公理，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\">\\(\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\)</span>。反向固定任意模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 和满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\)</span> 的世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>；令\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(p)=\\{y\\in W\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (M,y\\models\\Box^n p)\\}\">\\(U(p)=\\{y\\in W\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (M,y\\models\\Box^n p)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^0p=p\">\\(\\Box^0p=p\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(W,R,U)\">\\(N=(W,R,U)\\)</span>（其余命题字母的值任取）。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRy\">\\(wRy\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,y\\models\\Box p\\to p\">\\(M,y\\models\\Box p\\to p\\)</span>，因而\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,y\\models p\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ge1\\ M,y\\models\\Box^n p\\Longleftrightarrow N,y\\models\\Box p\">\\(N,y\\models p\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ge1\\ M,y\\models\\Box^n p\\Longleftrightarrow N,y\\models\\Box p\\)</span>。\n所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,w\\models\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\">\\(N,w\\models\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\\)</span>。框架上的 Henkin 有效性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,w\\models\\Box p\">\\(N,w\\models\\Box p\\)</span>，从而每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRx\">\\(wRx\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models p\">\\(M,x\\models p\\)</span>，得到原模型中的 Löb 公理。</p>\n<p>最后一个等价的短证明：框架有效式构成正规逻辑，Löb 有效性经 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a> 给出 4 有效性；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRx,xRy\">\\(wRx,xRy\\)</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRy\">\\(wRy\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为假即反驳 4，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 传递。若有非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq W\">\\(X\\subseteq W\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中的后继，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 恰在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为假；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\to p\">\\(\\Box p\\to p\\)</span> 在每个世界为真，Löb 公理却在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中为假，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 逆良基。反向若传递且逆良基，在任意世界的假 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 后继集非空时取其无 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 后继元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；传递性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\land\\neg p\">\\(\\Box p\\land\\neg p\\)</span>，于是该世界不能满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-henkin-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5ed2b55b4cca2b52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-l-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-l-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"最后一个等价的短证明：框架有效式构成正规逻辑，Löb 有效性经 [[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 给出 4 有效性；若 $wRx,xRy$ 而非 $wRy$，取 $p$ 只在 $y$ 为假即反驳 4，故 $R$ 传递。若有非空 $X\\subseteq W$ 且每个 $x\\in X$ 都有 $X$ 中的后继，取 $p$ 恰在 $X$ 为假；此时 $\\Box p\\to p$ 在每个世界为真，Löb 公理却在 $X$ 中为假，故 $R$ 逆良基。反向若传递且逆良基，在任意世界的假 $p$ 后继集非空时取其无 $R$ 后继元素 $x$；传递性使 $x$ 满足 $\\Box p\\land\\neg p$，于是该世界不能满足 $\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}frame\\text{-}correspondence}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF\\models\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)\\to\\Box p\n&\\Longleftrightarrow F\\models\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)\\to\\Box p\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"U(p)=\\{y\\in W\\mid\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (M,y\\models\\Box^n p)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^0p=p","display":false},{"tex":"N=(W,R,U)","display":false},{"tex":"wRy","display":false},{"tex":"M,y\\models\\Box p\\to p","display":false},{"tex":"N,y\\models p\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ge1\\ M,y\\models\\Box^n p\\Longleftrightarrow N,y\\models\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"N,w\\models\\Box(p\\leftrightarrow\\Box p)","display":false},{"tex":"N,w\\models\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"wRx","display":false},{"tex":"M,x\\models p","display":false},{"tex":"wRx,xRy","display":false},{"tex":"wRy","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq W","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p\\to p","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p\\land\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)","display":false}],"bytes":2451,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff346ee0085d8f22","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 [[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 $2^*$ 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 $\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}$；[[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 又给出 $4\\in\\mathrm{GL}$，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]] → [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]] → [[89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete]]"}],"outgoing":["5ed2b55b4cca2b52","dbba58e7bd3b0667","9f00301866fbd6f0","c6ab46cd662b1409","e2ade50b86346886"]}